{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"dismantle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:9Ensembles16CoreDataEnsembleC9dismantleyyF","title":"dismantle()","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Ensembles"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Forces the ensemble to dismantle, releasing all resources.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dismantle"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Normally dismantling happens at deallocation. Call this explicitly when you need to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create a replacement ensemble for the same store, to prevent two ensembles from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accessing the same data concurrently."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns at once. Captures stop and queued work is cancelled immediately. With no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"operation running, the event store is closed before this returns, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replacement ensemble can open the same store straight away. While an operation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is running, it finishes its current step and the event store is closed on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"operation queue once it has, so the database is never taken away from work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still using it. A replacement ensemble created straight away opens the store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"once the old operation’s current transaction ends, which blocks the creating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread for that long. If an attach was running, wait for the old ensemble’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreDataEnsembleWillEndActivity"},{"type":"text","text":" notification before creating a replacement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"at the same local data root: a stopped attach removes the event store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directory it was building, as any failed attach does.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ensembles\/coredataensemble\/dismantle()"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble\/dismantle()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles","doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble"]]},"references":{"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync Core Data and SwiftData stores across devices using event sourcing."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ensembles","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles","kind":"symbol","title":"Ensembles"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/CoreDataEnsemble":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"CoreDataEnsemble","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The central class of Ensembles, representing a set of synchronizing persistent stores."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble","title":"CoreDataEnsemble","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CoreDataEnsemble","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/coredataensemble","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Ensembles/documentation/Ensembles/CoreDataEnsemble/dismantle()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismantle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Forces the ensemble to dismantle, releasing all resources.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreDataEnsemble\/dismantle()","type":"topic","title":"dismantle()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ensembles\/coredataensemble\/dismantle()","kind":"symbol"}}}